# Master spec

Before changing API, invariants, sharding semantics, or acceptance:

1. Read and follow **`.ai/master-spec.yaml`** (agent source of truth).
2. Keep **`docs/master-spec.md`** in sync in the same change.
3. Bump `version` / `last_updated` in the YAML when contracts change.

Hard rules (summary):

- MVP = control plane only (no SQL proxy, no tenant-per-shard).
- `mode` / `bucket_axis` / `bucket_spec` immutable after bootstrap.
- Exactly one `active` shard per `bucket_id`; FSM `standby → active → sealed`.
- Hot-add only as `standby`; admin/internal need `CLUSTER_KEY`.
- GitHub remotes: SSH only — never fall back to HTTPS on key errors.
